        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gatmooda was sugoocheanda siguura Ataliya bea ng'eanyiida Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah Ataliya was gheamata Ahasiya gideaba nimi orjeedaanyi, hean ghang'eat ak ghwanung' goosha jeata sean bea sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Yehosheba hudeaba Yorameeda was sugoocheanda, nea gaba geenyea Ahasiya. Hean gageanu Yoashi orjeeda Ahasiya ak gwajagwat aba bugusta orjooga jea gwanuus sugoocheanda. Ak ghafuy niny sea huda arear niny aba uhuuda bulaliida mida jeeda ghooriida, hean ghafuy ea mwadaaha Ataliya hean ghaghu ea mudeenuus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwandeay sea niny gweanyeew lah nea ghafuy aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea goombal Ataliya ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba ispwa goojeakta Yehoyada buuneeda eeyeadu fuga hees ambal furiischoodiga, ea furiischoodiga, ak ghapka headaanyi jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwasin neajeeda sea saawa nea ghwaak habeawooda sea saawa aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak goohiimsa saawa orjeedida bea Ng'utamiidean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa saawa gichea gwasin nea gwayeesha, “Nih ng'asheanda jea asina gil: Aba jeeda fih samwagu ang'waay sabaato, ageani siyagi ghoah furiischoocheanda gheeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siyagi aba jeeda fih samwagu gaygwanda dooshta Suri, nea siyagi gwanda dooshta neekeewa furiischoodiga ak gajafura gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheamughuushcheew iyeenya aba jeedeang'wa was furiischoodiga alageanyi, gaygafur gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwaneaweesa sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajaneaweesiina sugoocheanda aba meadajeega sean. Nea gaba siisi mideawa dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda, nea giliwas sih nyooh gwaneawu gajeenuus. Ak gajooteayeena sugoocheanda, iirita nea gabiigu gah.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasinda fuga hees ambal furiischoodiga gidarukusiinda ng'asheega sean Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda, gaba nih geanu fugaaschi geaweay sabaato ea gea riteawa sabaato. Ak geapka heeda Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu ashoohoocheandida ak ghoadaw fuga hees ambal furiischoodiga Ng'utkeaka ea igeambooniga ghayi bea sugoocheanda was Dawdi, ghayi mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghamiinaada furiischoodiga, nea gaba siisi mideawa dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda. Ghang'eada meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea gheeda ea gagul wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea meatkweeda gheeda. Nea geeneaweesa heeda wagiida ea gheeda nea geeneaweesa sugoocheanda meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geeruudu jarooda orjeeda sugoocheanda. Ak geayiin uhuuda shiipcheanda, nea geataw deaweedajeega bea gichea goombaliischeata, ak geanung' ghoah sugoocheanda ak geamwaar nea geabwar baneaguuka nea geeyi, “Sugoocheanda gagasa nyasa giibinda geaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Ataliya ghuuta furiischoodiga, ea gea buuneeda, hean gawa jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghwahita heeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'wearda ghwadaah sugoocheanda nea ghamiinaada aba murdeeda daraneeda gawuurji gideaba eawoojisu bea gealaan. Nea fuga hees ea fuga guuda durumbeati, gwanda murdeeda sugoocheanda hean gahoosan buuneesean bea ng'eanyiida nea geeghuut durumbeati. Hean ghabwaashaada Ataliya hang'weakaaschi ak gooyeawda nea gwayi, “Noong'usean foolayda! Noong'usean foolayda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda ak gwarukusa shirikarajeega hees ambal lugooda nea gwayeesha, “Ooruuteawana jeeni nea siida jea gweadu geeshta goonuuschi aba ng'uta?” Aba gideaba gwayi ashoohoocheanda, “Adeenuuksa jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geang'waay Ataliya ak geayaat nea geanung' ghwala naweeda faraasi bea gheeh sugoocheanda, ak geenuus aba hoowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada geayam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin neajeeda Yehoyada ea NG'UTAMIIDA ea sugoocheanda ea buuneeda, aba gideaba ghoah fuga NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak gwasin gicha sea sugoocheanda ea buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay buuneesean bea ng'eanyiida gheeda Baali, ak geenyarja heeda wagiida nea geehirjeaweada haleanjeeda sanaamu. Ak geenuus Matani was ashoohoocheanda Baali aba madeeda heeda wagiida. Ng'ata ghwayiin Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda furiischoodiga gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu fuga hees ambal furiischoodiga, ea fuga Gari, ea furiischoodiga ea fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida. Hean geeyeadu sugoocheanda gwararang'eesa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea geesku naweeda gidaghuuta furiischoodiga ea eahita gheeda sugoocheanda. Ak goopteada aba hoorgeeda sugoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gang'weela fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida nea gwayi saw mujiini. Ak geenuus Ataliya aba ng'uta, aba murdeeda gheeda sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
